Modifications on branch nucleic-acids
-------------------------------------
Evaluation of DNA/RNA pKa and protonation support, by noshou (git user of this
repository). Every added parameter value is recorded with its source in
SOURCES.md. Modified files carry a note naming this branch and its author next to
the original header.

Performance and solver changes on this branch: the SOR relaxation factor is computed from the grid, a quadratic
vector insert and the MPI C++ bindings were replaced, the dielectric maps are reused between the two states of a
titratable site, the Poisson-Boltzmann solves can run on OpenMP threads, on a GPU (OpenCL) and, per MPI rank, with several SOR half sweeps per pass over the grid (scripts/run_parallel.py), and the titration step looks up its pair energies once per cluster instead of once per state. Each modified
source file starts with a note saying what changed in it.
